Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.04,0:00:02.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In the battle with Archbishop Orwell,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.63,0:00:07.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,in which she tried to use Akari's Pure Concept of Time\Nto regain her youth,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.29,0:00:11.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I came in contact with Akari's consciousness\Nand realized something.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.33,0:00:17.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Akari had rewound time back several months\Nto relive the time she had spent with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.92,0:00:22.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The reason she was so friendly from the moment we\Nmet was a remnant of what she had already experienced.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.25,0:00:28.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That means despite earning so much of Akari's trust,\NI somehow failed to kill her.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.21,0:00:33.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's why this time, I'll make sure I kill Akari.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.04,0:00:38.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Deep within me,\Nthere's another personality I don't even know about.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.33,0:00:44.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's the true Akari Tokitou,\Nwho remembers everything from before I regressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.00,0:00:50.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The true me rewound time just so\NI could prevent Menou's death.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.71,0:00:53.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't you die, Menou.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.42,0:00:56.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And this time...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.04,0:00:59.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Make sure you kill me properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.33,0:01:03.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"These gates are open to any who wish to pass through."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.38,0:01:09.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"Be they healthy, ill, happy, unhappy,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.04,0:01:13.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,diligent, slothful, wise, foolish..."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.88,0:01:17.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"be they devout followers or any kind of heretic,"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.33,0:01:20.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"be they pure or evil of heart,"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.50,0:01:22.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"these holy gates are open unto them."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.21,0:01:27.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's a quote that represents the spirit of pilgrimage.\NI like these words.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.25,0:01:31.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They say leaving through these gates and finishing\Nthe journey absolves people of all of their sins,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.46,0:01:33.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and that they're reborn anew.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.46,0:01:37.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see they issued you a new scripture, Menou.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.46,0:01:40.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes. The acting archbishop arranged it for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.96,0:01:45.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I also got enough travel funds for the time being,\Nso we can set off without any worries.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.17,0:01:47.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, off we go on a pilgrimage!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.67,0:01:49.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,...Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.88,0:01:52.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Our destination is the Sanctuary.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.92,0:01:55.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's on this pilgrimage route, way off at the very end.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.08,0:01:57.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.25,0:02:01.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's a residential area for Lost Ones\Nthere that can take me in, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.88,0:02:05.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But even if the trip is smooth it\Nwill still take about three months.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.92,0:02:08.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No problem! As long as I'm with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.79,0:02:10.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then let's get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.50,0:02:12.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh hey. Wait, Menou.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.96,0:02:15.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,As long as we're doing this,\Nlet's take the first step together.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.96,0:02:16.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.92,0:02:19.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, all right. Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.75,0:02:20.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okay, here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.63,0:02:23.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ready, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.88,0:02:27.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's right, this is a fresh new step,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.54,0:02:34.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,toward finding a way to kill Akari and carrying\Nout the deed with my very own hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.63,0:04:30.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, Menou.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.75,0:04:34.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This place... Uh, the "wilderness area," was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.58,0:04:36.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You mean the Wild Frontier?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.46,0:04:41.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The environment is so harsh that humans\Ngave up on pioneering it altogether.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.75,0:04:45.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Stretches of it lie in between the countries.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.88,0:04:48.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Didn't you say there are scary creatures out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.67,0:04:50.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The monsters. Yes, there are.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.83,0:04:55.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There are also outlaws around who\Ncall themselves "adventurers."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.00,0:04:58.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The area seems awfully normal, considering.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.00,0:05:01.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is the pilgrimage route, so it's relatively safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.88,0:05:05.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But we'll see just how long you're so optimistic.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.54,0:05:09.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll be just fine! This is gonna be a breeze!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.63,0:05:15.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Come on, Menou! Hurry, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.04,0:05:16.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Fine, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.96,0:05:20.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can't go on anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.96,0:05:23.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Like I said, it's only a bit farther.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.83,0:05:25.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is wearing down my soul!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.96,0:05:29.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If it was, you wouldn't be saying that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.92,0:05:31.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, that's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.50,0:05:35.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,When you're really worn down,\Nyou don't even have the energy to complain.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.96,0:05:37.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.63,0:05:42.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Want to know why my soul is still fulfilled,\Neven on such a tough journey?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.58,0:05:43.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.38,0:05:45.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You really do, huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.50,0:05:46.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's because...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.00,0:05:51.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You, my emotional oasis-is right by my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.17,0:05:59.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, I think you're draining me of all of my energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.21,0:06:02.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Can't you find a more self-sufficient\Nway to boost your spirits?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.54,0:06:06.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can only get Menou nutrients from the real thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.04,0:06:07.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll shrivel up if I don't get enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.50,0:06:08.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No you won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.13,0:06:12.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You lived just fine for sixteen years before you met me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.92,0:06:16.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I have no recollection of those sixteen years anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.04,0:06:20.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's all about today, Menou.\NWe're young and we should only live in the present.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.79,0:06:24.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You should look back on the past and\Nthink about the future at least a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.75,0:06:27.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Look, our future is coming into view.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.50,0:06:33.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wow, it's a town! The ocean's so big! And blue!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.17,0:06:37.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's the Port City of Libelle. It's nice and relaxing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.04,0:06:40.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ooh, I can't wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.17,0:06:42.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Look, it's the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.54,0:06:45.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.75,0:06:47.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's the first time you see it, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.71,0:06:48.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.96,0:06:51.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't you have anything to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.13,0:06:52.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's big.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.33,0:06:54.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is that all?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.71,0:06:56.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.88,0:07:00.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You really are so emotionless, girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.46,0:07:04.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.50,0:07:06.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is that fog?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.83,0:07:11.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"Fog," hmm? Technically, not quite.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.17,0:07:14.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's none other than one of the\NFour Major Human Errors scattered around the world:
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.29,0:07:17.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The Pandemonium.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.75,0:07:23.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sealed away in there is a calamity\Nthat almost destroyed the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.54,0:07:26.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Those who enter can never hope to come out again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.79,0:07:28.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A prison of fog.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.75,0:07:31.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.83,0:07:33.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Do you think those are clouds?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.63,0:07:36.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If the weather's going to take a turn,\Nwe should hurry, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.42,0:07:38.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.54,0:07:39.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.71,0:07:40.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.42,0:07:42.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That thing is always there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.83,0:07:46.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I need to stop by somewhere, so I'm going on ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.08,0:07:50.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wait for me, Menou!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.04,0:07:55.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We will be sure to process your request.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.25,0:07:58.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll be back. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.29,0:08:04.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Menou! Are you done?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.63,0:08:05.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.38,0:08:10.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But I can't believe you have to apply for travel\Nfunds at a church in every town we come across.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.96,0:08:14.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They're providing us with money. I can't complain.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.63,0:08:17.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And I guess we get to see the sights as a bonus.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.79,0:08:19.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, Menou!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.63,0:08:22.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's somewhere I want to check out!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.63,0:08:26.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There! The island with the castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.42,0:08:28.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, you mean Libelle Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.25,0:08:31.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, we can't go there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.58,0:08:32.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.54,0:08:37.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That island is the private property of Count Libelle,\Na dignitary of the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.42,0:08:41.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We can't go unless we're on special business\Nor there's an event or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.33,0:08:42.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Aw, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.71,0:08:47.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't be so discouraged.\NThere are plenty of other places to see here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.42,0:08:48.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.75,0:08:52.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It was a long two weeks on the road.\NWhy don't we splurge a bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.21,0:08:54.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"Splurge"?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.21,0:08:56.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah! Let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.04,0:08:58.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's go then! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.08,0:08:58.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Fine, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.21,0:09:02.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Flare's successor, Flarette, hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.50,0:09:04.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.63,0:09:06.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I remember her...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.50,0:09:12.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is so nice...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.88,0:09:16.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you seem to be enjoying this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.75,0:09:19.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, the fact that your idea of "splurging"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.67,0:09:23.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,is the public bath goes to show how strapped\Nfor money you've been, but anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.79,0:09:26.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's not it. It shows I live in honorable poverty.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.96,0:09:28.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I know, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.17,0:09:33.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're pure, just, and strong, as a priestess should be.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.79,0:09:35.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, Menou.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.04,0:09:39.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Our destination on this journey is some\Nplace called "the Sanctuary," right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.75,0:09:40.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.88,0:09:44.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If I go there, they'll take me in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.96,0:09:47.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But you know, I've been kind of thinking...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.75,0:09:51.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It wouldn't be so bad if I kept\Ntraveling around this world...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.58,0:09:54.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,With you, Menou.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.96,0:09:57.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't be silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.79,0:10:00.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The point of a journey is to get to a destination.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.67,0:10:04.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't know. I like taking side trips, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.71,0:10:05.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.50,0:10:08.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm getting out before you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.50,0:10:17.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.67,0:10:19.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Akari will be in there a little while longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.83,0:10:21.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.42,0:10:23.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Menou!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.13,0:10:25.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oooh, I haven't seen you in two weeks!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.92,0:10:31.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can feel your warmth. You're mine. All mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.50,0:10:33.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't share you with anyone else, Menou!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.38,0:10:36.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okay, okay. I'm impressed though, Momo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.29,0:10:41.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You traveled the Wild Frontier away from the pilgrimage\Nroute and still managed to get here before us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.42,0:10:42.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It was nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.46,0:10:49.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, I did get harassed a bit by that\Ncrappy little princess again on the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.13,0:10:50.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Princess Ashuna?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.67,0:10:54.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why would the princess of Grisarika\Ncome all the way out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.71,0:10:55.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.00,0:10:59.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She probably has a thirst for battle or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.75,0:11:00.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"A thirst for battle"?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.17,0:11:10.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I beat her down into the danger zone\Nof some ancient ruins and left her there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.54,0:11:14.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If I'm lucky, she's already dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.50,0:11:19.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.58,0:11:24.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Anyway, how long do you intend to stay here in Libelle?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.25,0:11:25.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.33,0:11:31.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't you remember this town is famous\Nfor teeming with those people?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.21,0:11:32.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"Those people"...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.21,0:11:35.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, do you mean the Fourth?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.75,0:11:39.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes. Despicable, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.13,0:11:42.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They insist they're a liberated Fourth class\Nwho aren't Faust or Noblesse or Commons,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.25,0:11:44.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,yet all they do is engage in random acts of terror.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.75,0:11:46.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They don't make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.50,0:11:48.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But they had quite a movement going for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.04,0:11:54.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If our Master hadn't captured\Ntheir leader a few years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.71,0:11:59.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,they may have been a threat to the world even now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.33,0:12:00.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes, exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.13,0:12:05.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I figure the Fourth have a grudge against Master Flare.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.88,0:12:07.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well yes, perhaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.50,0:12:12.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And you're called Flarette, "Flare's successor," you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.58,0:12:14.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So I need to be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.38,0:12:18.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes. Not that I'm too worried about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.75,0:12:24.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I did look into the Fourth in town just in case,\Nso I'll send the details to your scripture later.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.38,0:12:28.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Momo. I'm proud to have such a capable aide.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.50,0:12:31.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, you have every right to be proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.13,0:12:35.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,More praise, pleeaase!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.08,0:12:36.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.42,0:12:41.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sounds like Akari's about to come out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.58,0:12:42.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Awww.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.38,0:12:44.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, by the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.38,0:12:49.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Speaking of Boobalicious,\Nare you not going to try out the Pandemonium?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.71,0:12:55.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Otherworlder or not,\Nshe might not be able to escape if you toss her in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.33,0:13:00.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There might even be some crazy\Nmonster inside that would eat her for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.88,0:13:02.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Th-that's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.29,0:13:06.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you hadn't even considered it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.29,0:13:08.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I hadn't. I completely spaced out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.88,0:13:14.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's definitely more promising than the usual methods.\NIt may be worth a try.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.50,0:13:15.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sorry to keep you waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.63,0:13:18.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That was an awfully long bath, Akari.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.83,0:13:20.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is normal for a Japanese person.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.71,0:13:21.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It is?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.75,0:13:25.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, Menou. Weren't you just talking to someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.83,0:13:27.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, I wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.46,0:13:29.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Come on, Akari. Sit down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.75,0:13:31.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll dry your hair for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.50,0:13:32.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.25,0:13:35.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is just what I was worried about.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.75,0:13:38.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Menou isn't sure about killing that girl...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.17,0:13:40.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Am I hesitating?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.79,0:13:42.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, that can't be right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.75,0:13:46.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Menou.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.75,0:13:48.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm an Executioner.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.46,0:13:50.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And the job of an Executioner...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.54,0:13:53.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,is to kill Lost Ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.92,0:14:06.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Libelle is such an interesting place!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.79,0:14:10.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The area has lots of hills,\Nso the buildings were designed to accommodate that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.17,0:14:12.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.67,0:14:16.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The title would be, "The Ocean, the Town, and Menou."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.25,0:14:19.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, what a great shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.21,0:14:22.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thanks, I guess. I'm glad you're having fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.58,0:14:25.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm glad I'm having fun, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.54,0:14:29.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But it's really too bad we can't go over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.50,0:14:31.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's such a lovely castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.50,0:14:35.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Like I said yesterday, we can't set foot on that island.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.58,0:14:39.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But, we can look at it up close from the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.50,0:14:44.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sure we could borrow the church's boat.\NWant to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.00,0:14:44.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.54,0:14:48.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You can steer a boat, Menou?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.13,0:14:52.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm a pure, just, and strong priestess,\Npretty much capable of anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.04,0:14:54.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Just leave it up to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.38,0:15:01.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wahoo! This feels great!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.88,0:15:03.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's dangerous. Will you sit down?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.96,0:15:06.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And did you take that nausea medication I gave you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.83,0:15:08.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.58,0:15:19.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We're getting closer to the castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.21,0:15:23.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Did you say it belongs to a count?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.00,0:15:23.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.83,0:15:27.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But, ever since Count Libelle fell ill,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.38,0:15:30.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,his only daughter has been acting on his behalf.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.96,0:15:32.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Apparently she's still in her teens.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.79,0:15:36.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wow... Menou, you really know a lot, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.00,0:15:37.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I just heard about it at the church yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.25,0:15:40.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Though it was really from Momo.\N{\rSubtitle-2}That must be tough,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.71,0:15:42.63,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,being acting head of a household around my age.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.96,0:15:47.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,One of the initial members of the Fourth,\NCount Libelle also funded their operations.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.08,0:15:49.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now in his place,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.63,0:15:55.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,the person put in place as the leader of the Fourth in\Nthis city is his daughter, Manon Libelle.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.92,0:16:00.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are we sure she's in town now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.50,0:16:06.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She was spotted on the pilgrimage route.\NConsidering the timing, she must be.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.42,0:16:12.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why does it have to be the successor of Flare,\Nthe sworn enemy of the Fourth?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.13,0:16:14.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is she strong, this woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.63,0:16:18.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Rumor has it that she's the one who\Ntook down Archbishop Orwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.83,0:16:20.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We can't underestimate her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.71,0:16:22.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Lady Manon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.54,0:16:23.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.29,0:16:27.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Please share your thoughts on behalf of Count Libelle.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.29,0:16:31.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Um, why don't we just watch her for a while?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.54,0:16:34.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Perhaps she'll simply move on without doing anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.71,0:16:38.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Honestly, Lady Manon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.63,0:16:43.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, perhaps you're too young to know\Nhow much of a threat Flare was-
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.17,0:16:44.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.96,0:16:49.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My mother was killed by none other than her, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.88,0:16:56.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She was a useless woman,\Nconsidering the trouble we went through to get her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.67,0:17:02.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In any case, we must do something about Flarette.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.50,0:17:06.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Before it affects the distribution of our product.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.29,0:17:08.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll go and make a preemptive attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.96,0:17:11.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I assume that's all right with you, Lady Manon?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.88,0:17:14.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes. I'll be sure to tell my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.38,0:17:15.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.33,0:17:22.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I must take my leave now,\Nbut I hope you will all enjoy the sandwiches.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.67,0:17:26.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It would be a shame to throw them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.04,0:17:33.38,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,She's only a child, after all. We can't count on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.38,0:17:38.38,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,Well, at least the food she serves tastes good. I'll give her that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.58,0:17:49.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The Pandemonium...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.33,0:17:55.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A prison of fog that they say is easy enough to enter,\Nbut impossible to escape from.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.96,0:18:00.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Even for Akari,\Nwho can revive herself by regressing time...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.21,0:18:01.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This might just work.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.54,0:18:04.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see the drug has taken its effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.00,0:18:34.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.63,0:18:37.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, right. It's Libelle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.46,0:18:43.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm in the Pandemonium, so everything must be on track.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.21,0:18:45.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yup, glad everything's going smoothly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.25,0:18:48.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Whoa, there!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.92,0:18:54.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I have to get swallowed by that thing again?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.29,0:18:56.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How many times has it been?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.29,0:18:58.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It feels awful in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.08,0:19:01.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But, this place can't kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.50,0:19:04.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Menou.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.21,0:19:10.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What's this light?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.67,0:19:12.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This wasn't here the last time...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.58,0:19:20.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If Akari dies here, this journey will be over.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.75,0:19:26.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,After that, nothing changes.\NI'll just go back to life as an Executioner.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.58,0:19:31.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But, what's this pain I feel in my heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.29,0:19:32.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is it guilt?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.96,0:19:37.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, I don't deserve to suffer from that kind of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.08,0:19:48.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ooh, ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.54,0:19:51.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Uh, what? Why did I just bump my head?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.88,0:19:54.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wasn't I looking up at the castle?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.75,0:19:56.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.79,0:19:58.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.21,0:20:01.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,After you finished seeing the\Ncastle you said you were sleepy,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.29,0:20:02.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and snoozed off like an idiot, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.17,0:20:06.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And now you're suddenly up and all confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.04,0:20:07.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.75,0:20:11.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sorry Menou, after the trouble of bringing me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.58,0:20:13.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.04,0:20:17.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, were you actually sad being left alone for a while?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.83,0:20:19.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,As if!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.46,0:20:22.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I was grateful to get a bit of peace and quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.46,0:20:23.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's mean!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.75,0:20:27.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It would be nice to say you were sad,\Neven if you weren't.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.46,0:20:28.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Fine, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.67,0:20:30.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We're going back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.92,0:20:33.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My hair will get damaged from the ocean breeze.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.67,0:20:36.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, Menou?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.92,0:20:38.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.00,0:20:41.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You know why I slept so well?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.92,0:20:46.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I think it's because I feel so safe next to you, Menou.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.29,0:20:49.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.71,0:20:54.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The fact that Akari currently revives next\Nto me is probably because of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.79,0:20:59.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But by using her Pure Concept,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.63,0:21:03.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Akari is another step closer to\Nletting her power get out of control.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.13,0:21:05.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sure we're still okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.79,0:21:07.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, "okay"?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.38,0:21:12.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I mean this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.83,0:21:14.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.08,0:21:16.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's been bothering me a bit since I saw you in the bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.92,0:21:18.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I think you're still okay, just barely.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.92,0:21:22.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey! What do you mean, "just barely"?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.42,0:21:26.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Someone's in a good mood.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.79,0:21:29.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Come, this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.17,0:21:39.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.79,0:21:51.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Whew, I'm quite hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.92,0:21:54.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's see, what should I eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.50,0:21:58.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, I know. Perhaps I should go to the market.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.38,0:23:39.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Next episode: Monstrine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.50,0:04:08.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(102.4,504)}{\an7}Episode 7: Port City of Libelle
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.04,0:05:17.46,Caption-2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(486.4,396)}{\an7}Two weeks later
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.08,0:09:10.25,Caption-2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(716.8,151.2)}{\an7}Public bath
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.58,0:18:27.58,Caption-3,,0,0,0,,{\pos(230.4,309.6)}{\an7}Auto Etheric Connect (Condition: Met) - Improper Attachment
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.58,0:18:27.58,Caption-3,,0,0,0,,{\pos(435.2,360)}{\an7}Pure Concept [Time] - Unlock
